Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,塞思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我又輪迴了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,還有哪裡會痛嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是傷還沒完全好？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是女性嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你的記憶果然還是很混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,對喔  你是女性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你的名字叫尤里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:57.85,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:03.55,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! 蛻變化身吧 Growl Growl Growl
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:06.44,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:09.16,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ざばぁん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.98,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}潜伏しながら行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:14.60,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Guess Doubt 壊れる思考
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:17.23,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の殻破り 突き出る角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.23,0:01:19.11,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}正気はいらないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:20.53,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I'll take you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:21.86,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}破れハウトゥー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:24.70,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}笑えるわ 裏切りだらけの生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:25.86,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Bet on me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:28.12,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}吊し上げて堕とす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:31.65,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}それでは皆 Nice tripを
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.25,0:01:36.34,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手を伸ばしたその先に幸よあれ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:37.54,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}廻り廻って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:38.93,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}変わり変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:41.03,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}人の形捨て
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:42.69,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.98,0:01:46.47,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}救いよあれ 騙し騙されのゲーム
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:50.00,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一心不乱にあがいて 切り裂く逆境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.43,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}足元にTake care
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.43,0:01:53.45,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:57.40,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}憂いのない 電脳化されたHeaven
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:59.46,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一瞬の油断が最後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:03.30,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}剥ぎ取るよ化けの皮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:06.27,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:08.78,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Change! さぁ化けな Growl Growl Growl
